# ABI changes of libitscam_sdk accepted on purpose since compat/baseline:
# libabigail suppression specifications, read by abidiff in
# tools/compat/check-compat.sh.  Every entry needs a release note and a
# release that may break callers (docs/compatibility.md).  Example:
#
#   # 0.10.0: RestApiClientConfig gained three fields; C++ callers rebuild
#   [suppress_type]
#     name = itscam::rest_types::RestApiClientConfig
